      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I did my research and knew what I was in for but beware of high pressure sales. Since signing up the service was terrible, organisation of the install was abysmal could not complete job on day of install due to pre work not being completed even though Sun Source Group had 7weeks to organise work. I've had nothing but heartache and grief trying to get my 7.5kw system installed, saying that installer was fantastic and worked very hard. Post install service is just as bad, I've suffered a blown switch (which happens) however after 7 days of ringing to get it repaired I'm still waiting to hear back from the company. The solar system and associated products seem to be good but service and organisation from the company is second rate.",
